SilphCo_7F_Text_HaveMonForSavingUs::
    .string "Oh! Hi! You're not CORPUS! You\n"
    .string "came to save us? Why, thank you!\p"
    .string "I want you to have this DAEMON for\n"
    .string "saving us.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_ObtainedLaprasFromEmployee::
    .string "{PLAYER} obtained a FERRY from the\n"
    .string "FOUNDRY employee!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_ExplainLapras::
    .string "It's FERRY. It's very intelligent.\p"
    .string "We kept it in our lab, but it will\n"
    .string "be much better off with you!\p"
    .string "I think you will be a good USER\n"
    .string "for FERRY!\p"
    .string "It's a good swimmer. It'll give you\n"
    .string "a lift!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RocketBossWentToBoardroom::
    .string "TEAM CORPUS's BOSS went to the\n"
    .string "boardroom! Is our PRESIDENT OK?$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_OhNo::
    .string "あ‥　もう　もてないぞ$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_SavedAtLast::
    .string "たすかったよ　ありがと！$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RocketsAfterMasterBall::
    .string "TEAM CORPUS was after the ROOTBOX\n"
    .string "which will bind any DAEMON!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_CanceledMasterBallProject::
    .string "We canceled the ROOTBOX project\n"
    .string "because of TEAM CORPUS.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_BadIfTeamRocketTookOver::
    .string "It would be bad if TEAM CORPUS\n"
    .string "took over FOUNDRY or our DAEMON!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_WowYouChasedOffTeamRocket::
    .string "Wow! You chased off TEAM CORPUS\n"
    .string "all by yourself?$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_ReallyDangerousHere::
    .string "You!\n"
    .string "It's really dangerous here!\p"
    .string "You came to save me?\n"
    .string "You can't!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_ThankYouSoMuch::
    .string "Thank you so much!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "Someone's MARK isn't scanning.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Closing the ticket.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "The BOSS takes meetings by\n"
    .string "appointment only.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_JoshuaIntro::
    .string "Heheh!\p"
    .string "You mistook me for a FOUNDRY\n"
    .string "worker?$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_JoshuaDefeat::
    .string "I'm done!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_JoshuaPostBattle::
    .string "Despite your age, you are a\n"
    .string "skilled USER!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Second of four on this account!$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "Escalating to the others.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "The account is well staffed.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "You're not on today's calendar.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Understood.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "You should go. The BOSS dislikes\n"
    .string "surprises.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalWhatKeptYou::
    .string "{RIVAL}: You took your time,\n"
    .string "{PLAYER}.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalIntro::
    .string "{RIVAL}: There you are. I thought\n"
    .string "you would come up this way.\p"
    .string "TEAM CORPUS held you up. I walked\n"
    .string "round them.\p"
    .string "I saw you in BRAZEN. I wanted to\n"
    .string "see if anything had changed.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalDefeat::
    .string "So. You are ready for BOSS CORPUS.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalVictory::
    .string "{RIVAL}“おまえなあ‥\p"
    .string "こんな　うでまえじゃ\n"
    .string "まだまだ‥\l"
    .string "いちにんまえ　とは　いえないぜ$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_RivalPostBattle::
    .string "Well, {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "I am going on ahead.\p"
    .string "The INDEX shows me what is strong\n"
    .string "now, and what it turns into.\p"
    .string "I am going to the DAEMON LEAGUE.\n"
    .string "The REVIEW BOARD can move over.\p"
    .string "I will be the strongest USER there\n"
    .string "is.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}. You will be all right.\n"
    .string "Probably.$"

SilphCo_7F_Text_FloorSign::
    .string "FOUNDRY CO. HEAD OFFICE 7F$"

